{"projectInfo":{"name":"NAT444端口块动态映射配置","path":"nat444","visibility":2,"categoryId":31,"introduction":"内部网络中的10.110.10.0/24网段的用户可以访问Internet，其它网段的用户不能访问Internet。基于NAT444端口块动态映射方式复用两个外网地址202.38.1.10和202.38.1.11，外网地址的端口范围为1024～65535，端口块大小为300。当为某用户分配的端口块资源耗尽时，再为其增量分配1个端口块。                                                                                                    ","label":["NAT444","NAT端口块"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"PC_2","resourceCategory":"终端设备","resourceModel":"PC","resourceVersion":"","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\PC_2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"MSR36-20_6","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\MSR36-20_6.cfg"},{"resourceName":"PC_1","resourceCategory":"终端设备","resourceModel":"PC","resourceVersion":"","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\PC_1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"ISP","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\ISP.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SW","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S5820V2-54QS-GE","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.075-A7571","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SW.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Router","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Router.cfg"}]}